">{{ $node[\"Webhook: Recibir Reserva\"].json[\"slot\"] }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"detail-section\">\n      <p><strong>Contacto:</strong> {{ $node[\"Webhook: Recibir Reserva\"].json[\"name\"] }} ({{ $node[\"Webhook: Recibir Reserva\"].json[\"email\"] }})</p>\n      <p><strong>Empresa:</strong> {{ $node[\"Webhook: Recibir Reserva\"].json[\"company\"] }}</p>\n      <p><strong>Cuello de botella técnico:</strong><br>\n      <span style=\"color: #475569;\">\"{{ $node[\"Webhook: Recibir Reserva\"].json[\"bottleneck\"] }}\"</span></p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"{{ $json.htmlLink }}\" class=\"btn-admin\">Ver en Google Calendar</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
